RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Creek County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 47% of normal in January to February and 182% in April to May. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 44% on the middle of the grids. Grid 18736 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
